L.add('John.3.5',d,'Decree XVI, p. 139, fn †','footnote reference (editor\'s)','We believe Holy Baptism, which was instituted by the Lord, and is conferred in the name of the Holy Trinity, to be of the highest necessity. For without it none is able to be saved, as the Lord saith, \'Whosoever is not born of water and of the Spirit, shall in no wise enter into the Kingdom of the Heavens.\'',ROB,TVI,'https://archive.org/details/actsdecreesofsyn00orth','John iii., 5')
