L.add('Acts.8.12',d,'Decree XVI, p. 140, fn †','footnote reference (editor\'s)','And in the Acts it is said that the whole houses were baptised, and consequently the infants.',ROB,TVI,'https://archive.org/details/actsdecreesofsyn00orth','Acts viii., 12; xvi., 33')
L.add('Acts.16.33',d,'Decree XVI, p. 140, fn †','footnote reference (editor\'s)','And in the Acts it is said that the whole houses were baptised, and consequently the infants.',ROB,TVI,'https://archive.org/details/actsdecreesofsyn00orth','Acts viii., 12; xvi., 33')
