L.add('1Cor.6.11',m,'I. Q. 102–103 (fruits of baptism)','inline reference','Secondly, It plainly renews or regenerates the Man, and restores him to that State of Justice and Righteousness wherein he stood before […]; As the Apostle testifies (1 Cor. vi. 11), But ye are Washed, but ye are sanctified, but ye are justified, in the Name of the Lord Jesus, and by the Spirit of our God.',OVB,TO,'https://archive.org/details/cu31924029363094','1 Cor. vi. 11')
L.add('Gal.3.27',m,'I. Q. 102–103 (fruits of baptism)','inline reference','Moreover, by Baptism we become Members of Christ\'s Body, and put on the Lord Jesus, as the Apostle witnesseth (Gal. iii. 27), As many of you as have been Baptized with Christ have put on Christ.',OVB,TO,'https://archive.org/details/creedschristendo02scha'.replace('creedschristendo02scha','cu31924029363094'),'Gal. iii. 27')
